<speech id="uk.org.publicwhip/westminhall/2016-02-01a.286.1" person_id="uk.org.publicwhip/person/11592" speakername="Sharon Hodgson" colnum="286"  time="018:41:00" url="http://www.publications.parliament.uk/pa/cm201516/cmhansrd/cm160201/halltext/160201h0001.htm#160201h0001.htm_spnew138">
	<p pid="a.286.1/1">I was also recently contacted by two constituents: Lorraine Derrit and Evelyn Winstanley, who have worked for 42 years and 45 years respectively. Like others, they have said that they were not told at all by any letter that this was going to happen to them. The DWP has been negligent, so there should be some transitional arrangements.</p>
</speech>
